<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET-S.AFRICA BEAT INDIA BY 282 RUNS.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-S.AFRICA BEAT INDIA BY 282 RUNS.</headline>
<dateline>CAPE TOWN 1997-01-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>S.Africa beat India by 282 runs in the second test at Newlands on Monday.  </p>
<p>South Africa bowled out India for 144 in their second innings to win the second test by 282 runs on the fifth and final day.</p>
<p>Scores:</p>
<p>South Africa 529-7 dec (G.Kirsten 103, B.McMillan 103 not out, L.Klusener 102 not out, D.Cullinan 77) &amp; 256-6 dec (B.McMillan 59 not out, A.Hudson 55, D.Cullinan 55)</p>
<p>India 359 (S.Tendulkar 169, M.Azharuddin 115) &amp; 144</p>
